cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use the ESRA ontology, please cite this release."
type: dataset
title: "ESRA ontology"
abstract: >
  The terms of the ESRA namespace (https://data.energystoragera.org/ns#) used by the ESRA Data
  Platform of the Energy Storage Research Alliance. Each term states whether ESRA defines it or
  only gives a standard BattINFO, EMMO, CHAMEO, QUDT or schema.org term the name ESRA's records use.
authors:
